Day 27 – Prior Authorization Story Simulator

🎯 Challenge

Build a Prior Authorization Story Simulator using Claude AI to explain how the healthcare prior authorization process works through an interactive conversation.

📖 Project Overview

Today I created a simulator that walks users through the complete Prior Authorization (PA) journey—from the initial request to approval, denial, appeal, and final resolution.

Instead of presenting information as a long article, the simulator uses a conversation between a patient (Alfred) and a Healthcare Operations Specialist (J✨🐣🧿🧸), making a complex healthcare workflow easy to understand.

💡 What I Learned

One of the biggest lessons from this project is that Prior Authorization is not just paperwork.

A single missing clinical document or incomplete medical record can delay treatment, even when the treatment is medically appropriate.

Good documentation:

* Reduces delays
* Prevents avoidable denials
* Improves patient outcomes
* Makes the appeal process easier

